OL,3,GNEWSACouncil suspends #215k chief after
OL,4,A81 days in job                         
OL,6,FThe chief executive of a council has   
OL,7,Fbeen suspended less than three months  
OL,8,Fafter he was controversially appointed 
OL,9,Fon a salary of #215,000.               
OL,11,FDennis Bacon, who previously ran a     
OL,12,Ffive-star "luxury" hotel, began his job
OL,13,Fat Reform UK-run Norfolk County Council
OL,14,Fjust 81 days ago.                      
OL,16,FBut shortly afterwards it emerged he   
OL,17,Fhad provided a #50 dinner at his hotel 
OL,18,Fto the leader of the authority, David  
OL,19,FBick, before his job interview took    
OL,20,Fplace.                                 
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
