OL,3,GNEWSACouncil suspends #215k chief after
OL,4,A81 days in job                         
OL,6,FWhile the council did not give a reason
OL,7,Ffor Bacon's suspension, on Friday night
OL,8,Fit said it would "launch a formal      
OL,9,Finvestigation" with an interim chief   
OL,10,Fexecutive to be appointed next week.   
